sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Camila /chat
  participant AG as conciergeAgent
  participant API as Booking API
  participant WF as eventVenueBookingWorkflow
  participant ST as Mastra storage
  participant P as Patricia /admin
  participant SB as Supabase bookings

  C->>AG: Request venue proposal
  AG->>API: create proposal HITL
  API->>WF: start workflow
  WF->>SB: insert booking + runId
  WF->>ST: suspend snapshot
  Note over ST: Requires DATABASE_URL Postgres<br/>else in-memory loss on redeploy
  WF-->>P: queue item SAN-502
  P->>WF: resume approve or reject
  WF->>SB: update booking status
  WF-->>C: notification realtime Phase 2
